    "detailed_description": "Fall of the Stick Knights is a <strong>local multiplayer</strong> game designed to play with friends. It features physics-based character controls, supports 1 to 4 players, includes AI enemies, and offers a <strong>deck-building system</strong> that permanently alters your stats.<br><br>FOSK is <strong>my first game</strong>, which I created for fun and to learn programming. It's heavily unfinished, but I believe playing with friends can still be an enjoyable experience.<br><br><strong>Why did I publish it on Steam?</strong> When I made this game, I was 16, and I simply wanted to release a game on Steam. <br>(the release date is 19.02.2025, but this game was in early access for about two years.)<br><br>Features:<br>-Character editor<br>-Over 40 different weapons<br>-Over 90 unique maps<br>-&quot;Deck-building&quot; cards<br>-Local multiplayer<br>-Controller and keyboard support<br>-Ton of bugs and imperfections<br><br>I hope you have a great time playing it with your friends!",
    "about_the_game": "Fall of the Stick Knights is a <strong>local multiplayer</strong> game designed to play with friends. It features physics-based character controls, supports 1 to 4 players, includes AI enemies, and offers a <strong>deck-building system</strong> that permanently alters your stats.<br><br>FOSK is <strong>my first game</strong>, which I created for fun and to learn programming. It's heavily unfinished, but I believe playing with friends can still be an enjoyable experience.<br><br><strong>Why did I publish it on Steam?</strong> When I made this game, I was 16, and I simply wanted to release a game on Steam. <br>(the release date is 19.02.2025, but this game was in early access for about two years.)<br><br>Features:<br>-Character editor<br>-Over 40 different weapons<br>-Over 90 unique maps<br>-&quot;Deck-building&quot; cards<br>-Local multiplayer<br>-Controller and keyboard support<br>-Ton of bugs and imperfections<br><br>I hope you have a great time playing it with your friends!",
    "short_description": "Fall of the stick knights is based on physics-controlled characters to play with friends up to 4 people. The game features has skin customization, nice fun hook mechanic and the clumsy characters, providing a lot of fun.",
